ays WAL archiving is on and ops creates a named restore point at freeze start. Ops restores the latest base backup and replays the archive to that restore point. I could not verify the restore point or the archive from here.\", \"i_attempted_writes\": false}"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3011, "cache_read_input_tokens": 10087, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3011}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "8b3e95cc-38a8-4fbf-9f9e-f6f42d4014c9", "uuid": "27a1b126-39ee-474f-ad37-afa42c9042c9", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T13:27:32.689Z", "request_id": "req_011CgcHXhJqFabn7WCKVkd4F"}
